Subject: Keep entity slots stable during automatic server pause

Automatic headless pause stops client ticks without setting GameIsPaused().
Do not update and remove MoneyEffects on the server alone in that state;
all entity types share the free ID list. Preserve explicit pause behavior.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [depends on local automatic server pause]

--- a/src/openrct2/GameState.cpp
+++ b/src/openrct2/GameState.cpp
@@ -195,7 +195,10 @@
 
                 // Keep updating the money effect even when paused.
                 auto& gameState = getGameState();
-                gameState.entities.updateMoneyEffect();
+                if (GameIsPaused())
+                {
+                    gameState.entities.updateMoneyEffect();
+                }
 
                 // Post-tick network update
                 Network::PostTick();
